<title>USA: Visa group concerned about AmEx alliance.</title>
<headline>Visa group concerned about AmEx alliance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Visa credit card association said it is concerned about a credit card alliance announced Thursday by American Express Co and the Advanta Corp financial group.</p>
<p>Advanta, through its bank unit, will issue a Visa and MasterCard Rewards Accelerator credit card linked to the American Express Membership Rewards program.</p>
<p>Visa said in a statement it is &quot;concerned about the arrangement's potential negative effect on intersystem competition - something to which we have a longstanding commitment.&quot;</p>
<p>The group said it will review details of the announcement with that issue in mind.</p>
